# Typography

The app uses **Nanum Barun Pen (나눔바른펜)** only for product UI copy. It is **not** Gaegu, Gowun Batang, or Noto Sans KR.

- Loaded in `src/app/layout.tsx` via `next/font/local` (`@kfonts/nanum-barun-pen-otf`) → CSS variable `--font-hand`.
- Tokens in `globals.css`:
  - `--hand` / `--default` — use everywhere.
  - `--serif` and `--sans` alias `--default` (legacy selectors only).

## Rules

- Set `html { font-family: var(--default); }` and rely on `font: inherit` on buttons, inputs, and textareas.
- New styles: use `var(--default)` or `inherit`. Do not import other Korean UI fonts.
- Allowed exceptions: `ui-monospace` / monospace for codes, `Arial` only where map SDK labels require it.
- Do not reintroduce `font-family: "Noto Sans KR"` or `Gowun Batang` on screens the user sees.

```css
.page-title { font: 700 1.5rem/1.25 var(--default); }
.meta { font: inherit; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); }
```
